# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Kendin App — Environment Variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values.
# NEVER commit .env to the repository.
#

# ─── Flutter Client (--dart-define) ───────────────────
# These are passed at build time via --dart-define flags.
# They are PUBLIC and embedded in the app binary.
#
# Usage:
#   flutter run \
#     --dart-define=SUPABASE_URL=https://xxxxx.supabase.co \
#     --dart-define=SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJxxxxx

SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ...your-anon-key...

# ─── Supabase Project (Dashboard > Settings) ─────────
# These are configured in Supabase Dashboard, NOT in Flutter.
# NEVER expose these in client code.

# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJ...  (auto-set in edge functions)
# SUPABASE_URL=https://...           (auto-set in edge functions)

# ─── Supabase Edge Function Secrets ───────────────────
# Set these via: supabase secrets set KEY=value
# They are ONLY accessible inside edge functions.
#
# CRITICAL: Never place these in Flutter code or .env files
# that are bundled with the app.

# OpenAI — used by generate-reflection edge function
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...your-openai-key...

# Resend — used by send-email edge function
# Get your API key from https://resend.com/api-keys
RESEND_API_KEY=re_...your-resend-key...

# ─── Variable Ownership Matrix ───────────────────────
#
# | Variable              | Where It Lives               | Public? |
# |-----------------------|------------------------------|---------|
# | SUPABASE_URL          | --dart-define + auto in EF   | Yes     |
# | SUPABASE_ANON_KEY     | --dart-define                | Yes     |
# | SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE | Auto-injected in EF          | NO      |
# | OPENAI_API_KEY        | supabase secrets set         | NO      |
# | RESEND_API_KEY        | supabase secrets set         | NO      |
#
# EF = Edge Functions
